  "body": "Found by the second review of PR #2664 (comment 7001940070). The PR is merged (c49d36762).\n\nWhat happens: `crates/app/src/geometry/import/step_fit.rs:113-130` keeps the mesh of the kernel when a face fails the parameter check. It writes no log line and does not lower the fidelity of the model.\n\nRisk: a STEP file from a different writer can cause this fallback. Then the defect of #2600 (facets far off the true surface) can come back with no diagnostic.\n\nDone means:\n- The fallback logs the face and the reason.\n- The import measures the kept mesh of that face, or it marks the model as reduced fidelity.\n- A test pins the fallback.\n",
